      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹17.53 (vs ₹20.15 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹17.53 (down from ₹20.15 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹31.7b (up 2.4% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹4.86b (down 13% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 15% (down from 18% in 3Q 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Revenue is forecast to grow 13% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, compared to a 13% growth forecast for the Machinery industry in India. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 23% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 41% per year, which means it is tracking significantly ahead of earnings growth.",
